<p class="verdict-line">Couverture pure, style perfectible.</p>
<ul class="checks">
<li class="ok">go test <span class="stat">3/3 run(s)</span></li>
<li class="ok">go vet <span class="stat">3/3 run(s)</span></li>
</ul>
</div>
</div>
<div class="synthesis reco">
<strong>Recommandation</strong>
<p><strong>vanilla</strong> et <strong>skill</strong> convergent ; le run vanilla sans effet est écarté.</p>
</div>


